flowchart TD
  A["Is the issue the same one decided in the first suit?"] -- Yes --> B["Was it actually litigated and decided? (Parks)"]
  A -- No --> N("No issue preclusion")
  B -- No --> N
  B -- Yes --> C["Was deciding it necessary to the judgment?"]
  C -- No --> N
  C -- Yes --> D["Was the party to be bound a party to the first suit (or within a Taylor exception)?"]
  D -- No --> N
  D -- Yes --> E["Was the party invoking preclusion also a party to the first suit?"]
  E -- Yes --> Y("Issue precluded (mutual)")
  E -- No --> F["Is it invoked defensively? (Blonder-Tongue)"]
  F -- Yes --> Y2("Issue precluded (defensive non-mutual)")
  F -- No --> G["Would offensive use be fair under the Parklane factors?"]
  G -- Yes --> Y3("Issue precluded (offensive non-mutual)")
  G -- No --> N2("No issue preclusion")
